Z||000005||Old Lar||01-29-2001||11:52 AM||||Thanks for the update, Mike.  I hadn't realized he was as banged up as you indicate.  I hope he continues to improve. I hope he can get back into a Fiero.||||reg||14
Z||000006||mrfiero||01-29-2001||02:17 PM||||Yes.....he got pretty banged up.  He broke his left femur and got 3 contusions on his brain.  Those contusions have greatly affected his memory.  When Wayne and I visited with his parents they said that every day they went to see him felt like the first time to Anthony.....he had no recall of them visiting the day before.<P>I does sound like he is improving, but brain injuries tend to take a long time to fully heal.  <P>As for the kid in the SUV......he is being charged as an adult.  Probably vehicular homicide (or manslaughter) and a slew of lesser charges (wreckless driving, etc.).<P>Since he is being charged as an adult, he will get what's coming to him.  There hasn't been anything in the news, but when he goes to trial we'll hear more info.     ||||reg||1
